      "text": "Privacy model (the knockout)\n• Lender is NEVER an Invoice stakeholder — ACS for Lender B on INV-001 = 0 contracts\n• PreparePledge runs under SME-only informees → absent from Lender A transaction-tree projection\n• Tree inspector: Invoice nodes in Lender A view = 0  ·  \"The privacy isn't in the interface. It's in the commit model.\"",
